# Line endings are LF in the repository, everywhere.
#
# The tree is worked on from WSL through a 9p mount of a Windows disk, which
# hands every file back with CRLF. Without this, git stored whatever it was
# given: 444 files read as modified when nothing had changed, `git switch`
# refused to move between branches, and 16 files reached the index with CRLF
# in them. text=auto normalises on the way in, so what is on disk no longer
# matters.
*	text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched.
*.png	binary
*.glb	binary
*.ttf	binary
